ción crónica de grasa (fibrosis quística, cirugía bariátrica)","guid":"GVwTbGe5D-Yd8lCge6i3DQ","children":[]},{"id":"70","parent":"66","text":"- Enfermedad de células falciformes","guid":"a8sUuSOW0GonzFToG0t7jw","children":[]}]},{"id":"71","parent":"65","text":"- Manifestaciones","guid":"","children":[{"id":"72","parent":"71","text":"- Anemia hemolítica (4-6 semanas de edad)","guid":"FQewt20IuFUu2ipuOSzrhA","children":[]},{"id":"73","parent":"71","text":"- Alteración morfología eritrocitos","guid":"KKRzm31XYulLMtBbbojWLQ","children":[]},{"id":"74","parent":"71","text":"- Trombocitosis","guid":"","children":[]},{"id":"75","parent":"71","text":"- Edema del dorso de pies y área pretibial","guid":"VieZWFCDbQAXexdJNKc_jg","children":[]}]},{"id":"76","parent":"65","text":"- Tratamiento","guid":"","children":[{"id":"77","parent":"76","text":"- Vitamina E revierte anormalidades","guid":"O2dYkX6PvnYp1FzcY-pzvA","children":[]},{"id":"78","parent":"76","text":"- Suplementos diarios de forma hidrosoluble en malabsorción","guid":"ILZWeSCCkLkx240nYxpBQw","children":[]},{"id":"79","parent":"76","text":"- En células falciformes: 450 unidades/día → disminución células falciformes irreversibles","guid":"UQZH02tOhztkK3mKamJbPw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"80","parent":"0","text":"## DEFICIENCIA\\NDE COBRE","guid":"","children":[{"id":"81","parent":"80","text":"- Función","guid":"","children":[{"id":"82","parent":"81","text":"- Absorción y utilización del hierro","guid":"PxwHLBINaVJcd04aD590LA","children":[]},{"id":"83","parent":"81","text":"- Mantiene hierro en estado férrico para transporte de transferrina","guid":"KYiAmxEejahLBsy9KBg_EQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"84","parent":"80","text":"- Causas","guid":"","children":[{"id":"85","parent":"84","text":"- Niños malnutridos","guid":"","children":[]},{"id":"86","parent":"84","text":"- Lactantes y adultos con alimentación parenteral","guid":"OvLqhS7xQHpIzpWKW3V7Pg","children":[]},{"id":"87","parent":"84","text":"- Ingestión crónica de cantidades masivas de zinc","guid":"YMzNoSvo1s0se8MRTBtU3A","children":[]},{"id":"88","parent":"84","text":"- Resección gástrica o cirugía bariátrica","guid":"EBRQWBbeHlAfIuv-EjIagw","children":[]}]},{"id":"89","parent":"80","text":"- Manifestaciones","guid":"","children":[{"id":"90","parent":"89","text":"- Anemia microcítica con hipoferremia","guid":"fOkwnV31l9o35rUYCsCX0Q","children":[]},{"id":"91","parent":"89","text":"- Neutropenia","guid":"","children":[]},{"id":"92","parent":"89","text":"- Precursores eritroides vacuolados en médula ósea","guid":"OBO_RHKjAGQFoLdbQQwRHQ","children":[]},{"id":"93","parent":"89","text":"- No responde a terapia con hierro","guid":"Zow3NSklSn9HW8XeJag-Yg","children":[]},{"id":"94","parent":"89","text":"- Anemia macrocítica y sideroblastos en anillo → similar a síndrome mielodisplásico","guid":"OzKz0SPTE_g1R7KOZLs0bQ","children":[]},{"id":"95","parent":"89","text":"- Anormalidades neurológicas (mieloneuropatía)","guid":"NPGhoQBOf0wM03N-b-SMJg","children":[]}]},{"id":"96","parent":"80","text":"- Diagnóstico","guid":"","children":[{"id":"97","parent":"96","text":"- Nivel bajo de cobre sérico","guid":"Lz-_xlWiCQlLWgdkEAyNZw","children":[]},{"id":"98","parent":"96","text":"- Ceruloplasmina sérica baja","guid":"AYrf1nfVynZcJ-JDEZ8wLg","children":[]}]},{"id":"99","parent":"80","text":"- Tratamiento","guid":"","children":[{"id":"100","parent":"99","text":"- Oral: 0.2 mg/kg/día","guid":"","children":[]},{"id":"101","parent":"99","text":"- Intravenoso: 2.4 mg/día durante 6 días, luego semanal","guid":"DrPoxntKzkIj0UqxC50ZYw","children":[]},{"id":"102","parent":"99","text":"- Suplementos orales: gluconato de cobre (8 mg/día)","guid":"WUBmHFu3_8kWXbE1EVQlYA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"103","parent":"0","text":"##\\NDEFICIENCIA\\NDE ZINC","guid":"","children":[{"id":"104","parent":"103","text":"- Puede acompañar a talasemia o enfermedad células falciformes","guid":"TlsALhv-aJBSYDZ9NOc3Yw","children":[]},{"id":"105","parent":"103","text":"- No produce anemia de forma aislada","guid":"RSOzDxm7_Fxaj3XFAFZm4Q","children":[]},{"id":"106","parent":"103","text":"- Manifestaciones","guid":"","children":[{"id":"107","parent":"106","text":"- Retraso del crecimiento en niños","guid":"PY8QVA_XKFRlEZtOcoCx9Q","children":[]},{"id":"108","parent":"106","text":"- Deterioro cicatrización de heridas","guid":"ECWnoHHlDsxiZT4bP2VnZg","children":[]},{"id":"109","parent":"106","text":"- Alteración percepción del gusto","guid":"R4cX1S2_RYBPcfTNSRH3rA","children":[]},{"id":"110","parent":"106","text":"- Deficiencias inmunitarias","guid":"","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"111","parent":"0","text":"## ANEMIA POR\\NINANICIÓN","guid":"","children":[{"id":"112","parent":"111","text":"- Semiinanición","guid":"","children":[{"id":"113","parent":"112","text":"- Anemia normocítica normocrómica leve-moderada","guid":"JZUP9iuZ1xBasSfaNEj4vA","children":[]},{"id":"114","parent":"112","text":"- Precursores eritroides reducidos en médula ósea","guid":"JuSlUn6Ccow_5hIgACULbg","children":[]},{"id":"115","parent":"112","text":"- Principalmente dilucional","guid":"","children":[]}]},{"id":"116","parent":"111","text":"- Inanición completa\\N(9-12 semanas)","guid":"","children":[{"id":"117","parent":"116","text":"- Anemia","guid":"","children":[]},{"id":"118","parent":"116","text":"- Hipocelularidad médula ósea","guid":"ckIr5WPZZ0xdfKnnN2Xe9A","children":[]},{"id":"119","parent":"116","text":"- Disminución requerimientos de oxígeno (estado hipometabólico)","guid":"WjpyVVZDw1UReTDPKJVygw","children":[]}]},{"id":"120","parent":"111","text":"- Tratamiento","guid":"","children":[{"id":"121","parent":"120","text":"- Responde a reanudación de dieta normal","guid":"fZVjqDgMH6w3vEXVOyRz_Q","children":[]},{"id":"122","parent":"120","text":"- Realimentación → reticulocitosis y corrección déficit hemoglobina","guid":"R-NIABzN4SMtpSXyWAjvoA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"123","parent":"0","text":"## ANEMIA POR DEFICIENCIA DE PROTEÍNA\\N(KWASHIORKOR)","guid":"DrLv8BAKZA4XblcGVjoHxQ","children":[{"id":"124","parent":"123","text":"- Características","guid":"","children":[{"id":"125","parent":"124","text":"- Hemoglobina hasta 8 g/dL","guid":"PcmpjmbgS9MfS_9xY165hA","children":[]},{"id":"126","parent":"124","text":"- Normocítica y normocrómica","guid":"Enoi5Hn9J0wXp7JAOV7INg","children":[]},{"id":"127","parent":"124","text":"- Anisocitosis y poiquilocitosis importantes","guid":"eH-Z2FeNxGA5g9OlUroMLQ","children":[]},{"id":"128","parent":"124","text":"- Recuentos leucocitos y plaquetas normales","guid":"LdGHtUr9BHR7T36xIBOzmg","children":[]},{"id":"129","parent":"124","text":"- Médula ósea normocelular o hipocelular","guid":"LtZrwFjMKJhXeZKPLGvPaQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"130","parent":"123","text":"- Tratamiento","guid":"","children":[{"id":"131","parent":"130","text":"- Respuesta lenta a dietas ricas en proteína","guid":"ENhIRA812GRnkENmWLuQRQ","children":[]},{"id":"132","parent":"130","text":"- Posible episodio aplasia eritroide tras 3-4 semanas (responde a riboflavina o prednisona)","guid":"LAO5iBU1aVgwxH_lOrapeA","children":[]},{"id":"133","parent":"130","text":"- Pueden manifestarse deficiencias ocultas durante repleción (hierro, ácido fólico, vitaminas E y B12)","guid":"JT_NZkgy1uwQ8LE9Ywl29A","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"134","parent":"0","text":"## ALCOHOLISMO","guid":"","children":[{"id":"135","parent":"134","text":"- Causas\\Nmúltiples de\\Nanemia","guid":"","children":[{"id":"136","parent":"135","text":"- Deficiencias nutricionales","guid":"","children":[]},{"id":"137","parent":"135","text":"- Sangrado gastrointestinal crónico","guid":"LxMivzA8sK9GaDB4QY1Fow","children":[]},{"id":"138","parent":"135","text":"- Disfunción hepática","guid":"","children":[]},{"id":"139","parent":"135","text":"- Anemia hemolítica","guid":"","children":[]},{"id":"140","parent":"135","text":"- Hiperesplenismo por hipertensión portal","guid":"KjnX-14P4rl67A3aIrlx0w","children":[]},{"id":"141","parent":"135","text":"- Efectos tóxicos del etanol sobre eritropoyesis y metabolismo del folato","guid":"NZ2nGTRv4X91c34AY28uzw","children":[]}]},{"id":"142","parent":"134","text":"- Tipos de anemia","guid":"","children":[{"id":"143","parent":"142","text":"- Macrocítica (común en alcohólicos hospitalizados)","guid":"f2zl83DC_LEDguJpLkNRsw","children":[]},{"id":"144","parent":"142","text":"- Megaloblástica (por deficiencia ácido fólico)","guid":"SY8lSVr8dPharyEcWmdtjg","children":[]},{"id":"145","parent":"142","text":"- Cuadro \"dimórfico\" (deficiencia hierro asociada)","guid":"ajJNXUI_ZIIzIv3TFjYG5Q","children":[]},{"id":"146","parent":"142","text":"- Macrocitosis leve (90% de alcohólicos crónicos)","guid":"V3TN22PnfbhQ7LBdfLSbQQ","children":[]},{"id":"147","parent":"142","text":"- Hemolítica (síndrome de Zieve, anemia con acantocitos)","guid":"LBpUpGHdYZpfvhI2Wy13ZA","children":[]}]},{"id":"148","parent":"134","text":"- Particularidades","guid":"","children":[{"id":"149","parent":"148","text":"- Más común en bebedores de vino/whisky que cerveza (fuente de folato)","guid":"EhoSSSYmQq4cur0HPFPqRA","children":[]},{"id":"150","parent":"148","text":"- Trombocitopenia concomitante (efectos alcohol y deficiencia folato)","guid":"BDYlZxemyuFfDVwXOdPMgQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"151","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clínicas","guid":"7BB54B6AF55A4B96A29ABE2C","children":[{"id":"152","parent":"151","text":"DEFICIENCIA DE COBRE CAUSA ANEMIA HIPOCRÓMICA + NEUTROPENIA + SIDEROBLASTOS EN ANILLO; SIMULA SÍNDROME MIELODISPLÁSICO Y SE DEBE SOSPECHAR EN POST-CIRUGÍA BARIÁTRICA, ZINC ORAL CRÓNICO, NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL PROLONGADA","guid":"A75B4134661E489CA44A4232","children":[]},{"id":"153","parent":"151","text":"DEFICIENCIA DE VITAMINA C: ANEMIA NORMOCÍTICA-NORMOCRÓMICA + ESCORBUTO (PETEQUIAS PERIFOLICULARES, GINGIVORRAGIAS, HEMORRAGIA SUBPERIÓSTICA); ANCIANOS SOLOS Y ALCOHÓLICOS SON GRUPO DE RIESGO; DOSIS 1 G/DÍA POR 1 SEM, LUEGO 200 MG/DÍA","guid":"3D1AC18469CA4480BB6F6396","children":[]},{"id":"154","parent":"151","text":"DEFICIENCIA DE VITAMINA A: ANEMIA HIPOCRÓMICA QUE NO RESPONDE A FERROTERAPIA; CEGUERA NOCTURNA + XEROFTALMÍA; SUPLEMENTACIÓN MEJORA UTILIZACIÓN DE HIERRO","guid":"E75DB70CD25C44E0B2A96855","children":[]},{"id":"155","parent":"151","text":"DEFICIENCIA DE RIBOFLAVINA (B2) Y PIRIDOXINA (B6) → ANEMIA NORMOCÍTICA O SIDEROBLÁSTICA; B6 RECUPERA SIDEROBLÁSTICA HEREDITARIA LIGADA AL X (ALAS2) EN 50%","guid":"1529480D6607446AAA55D216","children":[]},{"id":"156","parent":"151","text":"ALCOHOLISMO CRÓNICO: ANEMIA MULTIFACTORIAL → MACROCITOSIS (TÓXICA DIRECTA, NO SOLO B12/FOLATO), DEFICIENCIA DE FOLATO, ZIEVE (HEMÓLISIS + HIPERLIPIDEMIA + ICTERICIA EN HEPATÓPATA), HIPOFOSFEMIA (HEMÓLISIS POR ATP↓)","guid":"81E475CDCA7A4E3BBF7436F9","children":[]},{"id":"157","parent":"151","text":"POST-CIRUGÍA BARIÁTRICA: DEFICIENCIA MULTIPLE EN ~50% A 5 AÑOS → HIERRO, B12, FOLATO, COBRE, VITAMINA D; SUPLEMENTACIÓN PROFILÁCTICA DE POR VIDA + LABS ANUALES","guid":"51FC64E8AB3D4BC39C078BD3","children":[]},{"id":"158","parent":"151","text":"KWASHIORKOR (DEFICIENCIA PROTEICA): ANEMIA NORMOCÍTICA NORMOCRÓMICA POR HIPOPLASIA ERITROIDE; CORRECCIÓN NUTRICIONAL GRADUAL → VIGILAR SÍNDROME DE REALIMENTACIÓN","guid":"A24AB1DCB40B477FBA67DFFF","children":[]},{"id":"159","parent":"151","text":"DEFICIENCIA DE SELENIO: ANEMIA + MIOCARDIOPATÍA (KESHAN); SOSPECHAR EN NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL DOMICILIARIA SIN SUPLEMENTO","guid":"BC5D471F5535494EA2317BFC","children":[]},{"id":"160","parent":"151","text":"ÁCIDOS GRASOS Ω-3 Y CARNITINA NO TIENEN ROL DEMOSTRADO EN ANEMIA NUTRICIONAL DEL ADULTO; EVITAR SUPLEMENTACIÓN INDISCRIMINADA","guid":"A908A43277494F44A6F8A445","children":[]},{"id":"161","parent":"151","text":"EN ANCIANOS CON ANEMIA INEXPLICADA Y DESNUTRICIÓN, EVALUAR ALBÚMINA, PREALBÚMINA, ZINC, COBRE, VITAMINA C Y B6 ANTES DE ATRIBUIR A ENFERMEDAD CRÓNICA O MIELODISPLASIA","guid":"EAE00F28FD6D4689A4CAC6D6","children":[]},{"id":"162","parent":"151","text":"Referencias","guid":"9D43CB10B0B74CC89765303D","children":[{"id":"163","parent":"162","text":"1. Williams Hematology, 10th ed. McGraw-Hill; 2021. Cap 38: Anemia caused by other nutritional deficiencies.","guid":"ED221F47B4AF4CC5984BE5F0","children":[]},{"id":"164","parent":"162","text":"2. Halfdanarson TR, Kumar N, Li CY, et al. Hematological manifestations of copper deficiency: a retrospective review. Eur J Haematol. 2008;80(6):523-31.","guid":"57ED48164AB84E85B453E4E4","children":[]},{"id":"165","parent":"162","text":"3. Hunt A, Harrington D, Robinson S. Vitamin B12 deficiency. BMJ. 2014;349:g5226.","guid":"F0AB872666644FE7AE4A8674","children":[]},{"id":"166","parent":"162","text":"4. Kumar N. Neurologic aspects of cobalamin (B12) deficiency. Handb Clin Neurol. 2014;120:915-26.","guid":"CFD0FCB5608A4D94BA6A7B36","children":[]},{"id":"167","parent":"162","text":"5. Mechanick JI, Apovian C, Brethauer S, et al. Clinical practice guidelines for the perioperative nutrition, metabolic, and nonsurgical support of patients undergoing bariatric procedures. Endocr Pract. 2019;25(12):1346-59.","guid":"67DC4BC8C59C40B087CB70C5","children":[]},{"id":"168","parent":"162","text":"6. Lanska DJ. The historical contribution of clinicians to the development of vitamin C and the discovery of scurvy. Clin Nutr. 2010;29(3):403-7.","guid":"4213B9548B14497886403DF7","children":[]},{"id":"169","parent":"162","text":"7. Ballard HS. The hematological complications of alcoholism. Alcohol Health Res World. 1997;21(1):42-52.","guid":"A1B41E4552874735B32DD2C6","children":[]},{"id":"170","parent":"162","text":"8. Lupu MA, Cobzariu A, Mihaila RG, et al. Riboflavin deficiency in pyridoxine-responsive sideroblastic anemia. Br J Haematol. 2005;128(3):348-55.","guid":"24C837252628474BBC51181A","children":[]}]}]}]},"node_count":170,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Estudios Pivotales","folder":"Estudios Pivotales","filename":"MENDS-2026","id":"map_265","resolved_references":[]}